  "title": "Card Launch Success",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "company": "JPMorgan",
  "premium": false,
  "question": "Your team at JPMorgan Chase is soon launching a new credit card. You are asked to estimate how many cards you'll issue in the first month.\n\nBefore you can answer this question, you want to first get some perspective on how well new credit card launches typically do in their first month.\n\nWrite a query that outputs the name of the credit card, and how many cards were issued in its launch month. The launch month is the earliest record in the monthly_cards_issued table for a given card. Order the results starting from the biggest issued amount.",
  "notes": [
    "Chase Sapphire Reserve card was launched on 1/2021 with an issued amount of 170,000 cards and the Chase Freedom Flex card was launched on 3/2021 with an issued amount of 65,000 cards.",
    "The dataset you are querying against may have different input & output - this is just an example!",
    "Hint: Try using a window function \ud83d\udc40"
  ],
  "tables": [
    {
      "table_name": "monthly_cards_issued",
      "columns": [
        {
          "column_name": "issue_month",
          "data_type": "INT"
        },
        {
          "column_name": "issue_year",
          "data_type": "INT"
        },
        {
          "column_name": "card_name",
          "data_type": "VARCHAR(255)"
        },
        {
          "column_name": "issued_amount",
          "data_type": "INT"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sample_data": {
    "monthly_cards_issued": [
      {
        "issue_month": "1",
        "issue_year": "2021",
        "card_name": "Chase Sapphire Reserve",
        "issued_amount": "170000"
      },
      {
